WEBVTT

00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:02.393
that every dollar higher
in the first offer

00:05:02.417 --> 00:05:05.875
translates into about 50 cents
more in the final agreement,

00:05:07.042 --> 00:05:10.375
but in a job offer you don't always
have the chance to anchor.

00:05:11.208 --> 00:05:13.059
A few years after taking my class,

00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:15.226
Grace got an offer
for a new consulting role

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.726
at a big tech company,

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.309
and the salary was
well below what she expected.

00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:24.309
GS: And it was funny because
I was talking to my brother about it

00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:26.667
and he was like, just take it.

00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.934
AG: But by then, Grace knew
that a counter-anchor makes a difference.